    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired; lightheaded only on standing quickly; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Nausea most of the day; vomiting four or five times a day; no pain or diarrhea</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Passing urine normally; no bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Discouraged but coping; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

